{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34332","headline":"寄茅山何道士 · 陆龟蒙","name":"寄茅山何道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终身持玉舃，丹诀未应传。\n况是曾同宿，相违便隔年。\n问颜知更少，听话想踰玄。\n古籙文垂露，新金汞绝烟。\n蜂供和饵蜜，人寄买溪钱。\n紫燕长巢硐，青龟忽上莲。\n箧藏徵隐诏，囊佩摄生篇。\n圃暖芝台秀，岩春乳管圆。\n池栖子孙鹤，堂宿弟兄仙。\n幸阅灵书次，心期赐一编。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}